Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：与星光一起归来的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继承了快斗的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把心园打倒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.70,0:00:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但那时，试图将这个世界与
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界融合的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}红色光柱，异常地增强了光辉。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那究竟是！？＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 会发生什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.12,0:00:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！ 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和异晶界那帮人在一起？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底 是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:47.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)璃… 璃绪也来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.15,0:02:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.93,0:02:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被人那样称呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉已经是好久以前的事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在的我既不是鲨鱼也不是凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.39,0:03:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安的纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)喵？你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼，你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说你是巴利安人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.70,0:03:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事怎么可能啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.51,0:03:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你倒是说句话啊！鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.12,0:03:34.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就让你看看证据！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我真正的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.00,0:03:39.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)巴利安之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:56.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)我们巴利安七皇！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.44,0:04:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)真正的银河眼使用者，米扎艾尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉格)万物皆在我手中！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.61,0:04:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)咆哮的铁拳连神都能粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.01,0:04:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.40,0:04:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)锵锵——！ 俺是贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.69,0:04:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)连灼热的太阳都能瞬间冻结！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.65,0:04:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冰之剑 梅拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.21,0:04:22.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)巴利安的白色之盾 多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.23,0:04:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而我就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}统领巴利安七皇之人 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你竟然是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安的纳修！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)鲨鱼…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.02,0:04:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 那座遗迹的传说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是你的真实记忆吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.54,0:04:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真实记忆？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.50,0:04:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我所看到的幻象
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是鲨鱼曾为一国之王的模样。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕 那个灵魂转生到了巴利安世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.60,0:04:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后变成了现在的他吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能有这种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.43,0:05:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克（Shark）的灵魂是以前那位国王的转世？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但既然转生到了巴利安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么又变成人类了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.09,0:05:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:14.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我知道的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他成了我们的敌人这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.81,0:05:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们明明是同伴{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么非得战斗不可啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)游马 这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是早已注定的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.65,0:05:32.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 我和你之间的命运！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}命运？ 开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我至今为止和各种各样的家伙决斗过。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.41,0:05:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与对手灵魂碰撞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此理解！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 如果你变成了巴利安{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我们之间的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说要斩断的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就再用决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那东西复活给你看！！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:05:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((璃绪～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.48,0:06:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定要为璃绪报仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔 不管你逃到哪里我一定要把你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 贝库塔！))
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是鲨鱼的记忆…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((是我夺走的。璃绪和同伴 大家的性命…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.27,0:06:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙本该战斗的真正对手是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切竟然是我干的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)这是游马的记忆吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.46,0:06:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊……你们也
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直背负着世界啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.91,0:07:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉古)纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……你……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)游马！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)连游马也……再这样下去……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(六十郎)撤退也是战术之一啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.07,0:07:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就先退吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有里人)这什么情况！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家，这里先撤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)小鸟、铁男！游马就交给你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}奥比塔尔！快斗拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)搞什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)那些家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳什)游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追上他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)是！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}海斗大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)他们没有追上来呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.36,0:07:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})逃脱 成功了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不能大意喵。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到你们了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(安娜)嘿呀～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:09.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么人！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.39,0:08:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是安娜！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.71,0:08:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算拼上这条命 也别想对我的游马{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碰一根手指头！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是小丫头敢碍事的人我绝不放过。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝不放过？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那这句话 该由我们这边…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾)该由我们这边来说！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(罗宾)今天也来大展正义身手。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾斯帕·罗宾 在同伴危机之时现在 登场！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}艾斯帕·罗宾… 还有安娜。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 得知世界危机的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗者们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都赶过来了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何 无论如何都必须得去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.04,0:08:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放我下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:08:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(六十郎)前面 不会让你通过的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(暗川)做好觉悟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:04.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 烟雾弹也是你们干的好事吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想追我弟子的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就先打倒我们再去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切 有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就按你希望的，把你碾碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…跑哪去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(砰)接得漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，想干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(砰)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.44,0:09:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是来挡你的路的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，记得是在决斗嘉年华上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和特隆决斗过的女人吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.41,0:09:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了同伴挺身而战吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(唰)这里你别想过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么来？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.13,0:09:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了放走同伴？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真像你的作风呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我永远都是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且璃绪小姐你应该也是一样的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾站在你面前的我，是梅拉古。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪已经不在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐就是璃绪小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)纳修……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被抢先一步了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.48,0:10:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里由我来挡住。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(V)等等。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.53,0:10:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不能让你过去。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是你唯一称作朋友的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真的能和那种对手战斗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.59,0:10:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为如此才必须由我去啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马被打倒的现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能打动那家伙内心的只有我。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。那么，把这个带上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是大哥开发的对付异晶人的王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经完成了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。不过……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。有了这个，就是百人之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 为了争取一点点时间你是来送死的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要通过决斗，把你和我之间的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重新唤醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.00,0:11:20.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就由我来做。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 你和我已经身处不同的世界了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算决斗几万次
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不可能互相理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我直到不久前也是这么想的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦破碎的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就再也不可能恢复原样了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.03,0:11:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊，想起来吧，凌牙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和你并不是那样的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果破碎了，就再一次只要重新连上就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.59,0:11:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用决斗给你开个洞{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.62,0:11:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到你那已经去了另一侧的心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送上火热的粉丝服务！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《游马 你感受到了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你通过决斗培养起来的羁绊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正要守护你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.32,0:12:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七皇是强敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但如今就相信吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信那些怀抱炽热信念战斗的他们》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)哎呀哎呀…… 总觉得{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.90,0:12:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事情变得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}越来越有意思了啊 纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:13:00.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我好好见识一下吧。你现在的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.60,0:13:07.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·哑剧人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.17,0:13:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将1只等级4以下的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.09,0:13:16.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·齿轮转换者！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:26.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 等级交叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将1张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让1只等级4以下的怪兽的等级
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择 哑剧人偶。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:45.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动机关傀儡·齿轮转换者的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:49.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用它的效果 将齿轮转换者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.46,0:13:51.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成和半驼兽·驼半兽相同的等级！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗……{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级8的半驼兽·驼半兽和
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.23,0:14:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.55,0:14:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.51,0:14:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.15！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.32,0:14:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}机关傀儡·巨人杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了啊，No.怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动装备魔法 机关护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.49,0:14:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以装备在机关傀儡的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽超量上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其攻击力和守备力互换。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，装备了这张卡的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有1个叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.11,0:14:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给予对方300点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨人杀手的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放单元有2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 接下这600点伤害吧！你就给我受着吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样。 多少 有点效果了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.55,0:14:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就 到此回合结束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤赛博鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着特殊召唤寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有水属性怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！ {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识下我真正的王牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的赛博鲨和
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鮟鱇{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ No.101！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承载未满足之魂的方舟啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从光芒无法触及的深渊浮上来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沉默的落胤骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 那家伙的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百红魔·No.！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.67,0:16:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}沉默的落胤骑士的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把1个超量单元去除{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你这家伙的巨神杀手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成超量单元！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.77,0:16:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)永恒灵魂收容所！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的巨神杀手…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用沉默的落胤骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:41.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.91,0:16:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}百万幻影猛击！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗。这就是异晶人的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:04.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.103！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(梅拉格)神葬零娘 拉格纳·零！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗？ 我早已{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.94,0:17:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身心都是异晶人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪小姐。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.99,0:17:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。看来你的决心是真的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊……我的决心也是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你拉回这边的世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.30,0:17:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠光暗影·暗·链接召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽区的叠光单位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随机选择1个送去墓地，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那是暗属性怪兽的话，
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.20,0:17:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把那只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤到我的场上！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果不是暗属性的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:17:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的生命值减半。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.33,0:17:59.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}概率是二分之一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择左边！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})中奖！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选中的是暗属性 巨型杀手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凭借这个效果特殊召唤成功的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.61,0:18:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了壁垒的你这家伙 我来接你了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就去那边的世界找你！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.34,0:18:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 升阶魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人混沌之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}区区人类
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有新的升阶魔法!?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.04,0:18:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是大哥创造出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.92,0:18:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托付给我的 人类的王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以将自己的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.73,0:18:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤出混沌超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级8的巨神杀手 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构超量网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CNo.15！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})人类智慧的结晶将{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出斩断命运之线的使者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}({\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe})机关傀儡·断头台！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}断头台的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙会消耗一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将你的怪兽击溃{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并给予你那只怪兽攻击力数值的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接砸到你身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.33,0:19:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灭绝斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.64,0:19:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.14,0:19:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被破坏的方舟骑士怎么会！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方舟骑士的另一个效果发动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.47,0:20:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能无效破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，你的效果结果就是失效了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 刚才那一下 你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元已经没了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定给我吃下我的粉丝服务吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.15,0:20:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 连环杀手攻击 方舟骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杰诺赛德加特林爆发！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.92,0:20:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这点程度你以为我的决心会改变吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.31,0:20:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正的混沌之力可不是这种小把戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:48.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是巴利安就到达不了的混沌深渊——
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.90,0:20:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你好好见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我和师父的联手面前看来根本算不上敌人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真难缠的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真正本事现在才要发挥呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶！居然被区区人类搞得这么费劲。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还挺有一套的嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.47,0:21:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好久没这么燃起来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 做好觉悟吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是我的真本事！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.94,0:21:26.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这股涌遍全身的力量是。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.66,0:21:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.57,0:21:37.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安混沌……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(大家)抽卡！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.28,0:23:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.57,0:23:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.98,0:23:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.90,0:23:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
