Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.71,0:24:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
